# Project: Chzzk AI Prompter (Mobile-First PWA)
- Tech Stack: Next.js (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Prisma (PostgreSQL), Node.js Worker (`tsx`).
- Target UI: Mobile portrait screen (375px~430px), OLED Dark Mode (#000000 / #111318), large typography for at-a-glance reading during live streaming.
- Rules:
  1. Always use strict TypeScript types. No `any`.
    2. Separate real-time WebSocket ingestion (`worker/index.ts`) from Next.js API routes.
      3. Never let LLM hallucinate numbers (donation amounts, visit counts). Inject exact DB values directly into the UI.
        4. Write all code comments and UI copy in natural Korean.
        